OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, charged with terrorism
OL,4,Aoffence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy from Nottingham has
OL,7,Fbeen charged with a terrorism offence.
OL,9,FNottinghamshire Police said the
OL,10,Fteenager - a white Polish national -
OL,11,Fwas arrested by officers from Counter
OL,12,FTerrorism Policing East Midlands
OL,13,F(CTPEM) on Friday.
OL,15,FHe was charged with engaging in conduct
OL,16,Fin preparation to commit terrorist
OL,17,Facts, contrary to section 5 of the
OL,18,FTerrorism Act 2006 the following day.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
